### 7. Test Invalid Request - Missing Title (Should return Bad Request)
POST {{serviceUrl}}/appointments
X-Correlation-Id: error-test-001
X-Consumer-Id: test-client
X-User-Id: tester@example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Description": "This should fail - missing title",
  "AppointmentDate": "2024-12-20T10:00:00",
  "Location": "Room 303",
  "PatientName": "Test Patient",
  "DoctorName": "Dr. Test",
  "DurationMinutes": 30
}

###

### 8. Test Invalid Request - Missing Patient Name (Should return Bad Request)
POST {{serviceUrl}}/appointments
X-Correlation-Id: error-test2-001
X-Consumer-Id: test-client
X-User-Id: tester@example.com
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Title": "Test Appointment",
  "Description": "This should fail - missing patient name",
  "AppointmentDate": "2024-12-20T10:00:00",
  "Location": "Room 303",
  "DoctorName": "Dr. Test",
  "DurationMinutes": 30
}

