### 10. Test Sensitive Data Redaction
POST {{serviceUrl}}/appointments
X-Correlation-Id: security-test-001
X-Consumer-Id: security-test
X-User-Id: test@example.com
X-API-Key: super-secret-key
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Title": "Security Test",
  "Description": "Testing sensitive data redaction",
  "AppointmentDate": "2024-12-20T10:00:00",
  "Location": "Room 303",
  "PatientName": "Security Test",
  "DoctorName": "Dr. Test",
  "DurationMinutes": 30,
  "password": "this-should-be-redacted",
  "token": "also-redacted"
}

