### 16. Create Appointment - PascalCase nested header
POST {{serviceUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Header": {
    "CorrelationId": "pascalcase-001",
    "ConsumerId": "pascal-consumer",
    "UserId": "pascal-user@example.com"
  },
  "Title": "PascalCase Header Test",
  "Description": "Testing with Header (PascalCase) object",
  "AppointmentDate": "2024-12-23T10:00:00",
  "Location": "Room 505",
